'''Frostfire Spear''' is a version of [[Nord Spear]] upgraded with a [[Frostfire Essence]]. It loses a small amount of [[Pierce|pierce damage]] in exchange for a larger amount of [[fire]] and [[Frost|frost damage]].

* Its primary attack is a thrust. 
* The secondary attack throws the spear for 1.5x damage.

An upgraded Nord Spear will '''NOT''' keep its upgrade level when it is crafted into Frostfire Spear.

